1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,796
Hey, I'm Jayden, and this is
JINtelligence.

2
00:00:03,846 --> 00:00:07,221
The study site that makes learning a lot
more fun.

3
00:00:07,717 --> 00:00:10,581
Got a question about anything? Ask the AI
tutor.

4
00:00:11,047 --> 00:00:16,230
It can help with any subject, and it
explains things step by step, so you
actually get it.

5
00:00:16,892 --> 00:00:20,228
It even has voice chat, so you can just
talk to it, and it talks back.

6
00:00:20,739 --> 00:00:21,625
Stuck on your homework?

7
00:00:22,117 --> 00:00:26,076
Upload a file or snap a photo, and the AI
will help you work it out.

8
00:00:26,639 --> 00:00:29,503
