watch your accuracy climb.

15
00:00:53,815 --> 00:00:56,966
Earn XP, rank up, and track every test you
do.

16
00:00:57,449 --> 00:01:02,032
That's how I got great scores, and you can
too. And the site keeps getting better.

17
